# IDEAS: EDIT on a page rolls one (a cycle, a figure, a line ...); SEL + EDIT goes back to the one before
wait 500
tap HOME
tap EDIT
expect par30 19
expect undo 1
wait 3000
shot idea_cycle.png
tap ENV
tap EDIT
expect par7 8
expect undo 2
press SEL
tap EDIT
release SEL
expect undo 1
expect par7 2
tap SEQ
tap EDIT
expect undo 2
press SEL
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
release SEL
expect undo 0
expect par30 5
